  "description": "<html>\n        <head>\n        \n        </head>\n        <body >\n        <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#111827; max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;\">\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:16px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:18px; font-weight:800;\">📚 Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Light Novel English Volume 1-26 Full Set - DHL</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">✨ <strong>Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation</strong> Volume <strong>1-26</strong> is offered here as an <strong>English Version FULL SET</strong> light novel collection in <strong>Brand New &amp; Sealed</strong> condition. This set comes with <strong>jacket matte laminate</strong> and is suitable for readers who want to enjoy the full story in an affordable local reading edition. 🚚 <strong>DHL shipping</strong> is available for this listing.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #fecaca; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; background:#fef2f2; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:800; color:#991b1b;\">📌 IMPORTANT EDITION NOTICE</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is a <strong>local / underground reading edition</strong> printed by <strong>Mangahouz</strong>. It is <strong>NOT an official publisher edition</strong> and is not from official publishers such as <strong>Viz Media, Square Enix, Kodansha, Yen Press, Tokyopop, Vertical</strong>, or similar official producers.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This light novel set is <strong>not recommended for collectors</strong>. It is suitable for <strong>first-time readers, casual light novel fans, and pleasure reading</strong>. The content follows the original story, but the printing, paper, trimming, cover finishing, jacket finish, and overall book production are from the local publisher.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Official publisher editions usually cost more. Minor trim, print, colour, paper, cover, jacket, or finishing variations may occur with local reading editions.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:800;\">✅ Quick Highlights</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">📚 FULL SET Vol. 1-26</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">🇬🇧 English Version</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">🆕 Brand New &amp; Sealed</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; background:#f9fafb; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 6px 0;\">🏭 Local Edition - Mangahouz</span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:800;\">📖 Story Overview</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation</strong> follows Rudeus Greyrat, a former shut-in who is reborn into a fantasy world with his memories intact and a strong desire to live a better life.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Across Volumes 1-26, Rudeus grows from a gifted child into a powerful mage as he faces dangerous monsters, magical disasters, political conflict, and emotional challenges from both his new life and his past.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">This long fantasy light novel series blends adventure, action, character growth, romance, worldbuilding, and redemption, making it a strong reading set for fans of deep isekai stories.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:800;\">📌 Key Details</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li><strong>Title / Series:</strong> Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation</li>\n<li><strong>Volumes:</strong> Volume 1-26</li>\n<li><strong>Set Type:</strong> FULL SET</li>\n<li><strong>Language:</strong> English</li>\n<li><strong>Author / Artist:</strong> Rifujin na Magonote</li>\n<li><strong>Genre:</strong> Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Isekai, Romance</li>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Light novel text-based reading edition with jacket matte laminate</li>\n<li><strong>Condition:</strong> Brand New &amp; Sealed</li>\n<li><strong>Publisher / Printing:</strong> Local / underground printing by Mangahouz</li>\n<li><strong>Intended Use:</strong> Reading copy, not suitable for collectors</li>\n<li><strong>Shipping:</strong> DHL shipping available</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; padding:14px; background:#ffffff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; font-weight:800;\">🏷️ Edition &amp; Quality Notes</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">This is a budget-friendly local reading edition made for light novel readers who want to enjoy the story without paying the higher price of official publisher editions. It is not an official collector edition.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Softcover / paperback light novel book format with jacket matte laminate</li>\n<li>Text-based light novel pages for reading enjoyment</li>\n<li>Minor print, paper, binding, cover, jacket, or trim variations may occur</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:12.5px;\">Collector warning: This item is not recommended for collectors who require official publisher editions, perfect finishing, official logos, or collector-grade printing quality.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:14px; pad